{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"16ded5dc4e2ddb729010e3886586b1a875952506b8d309b0047c2ac2b798eef4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["腰带的比喻"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对我如此说：「你去买一根麻布带子束腰，不可放在水中。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我就照着耶和华的话，买了一根带子束腰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和华的话第二次临到我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["「要拿着你所买的腰带，就是你腰上的带子，起来往幼发拉底河去，将腰带藏在那里的磐石穴中。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我就去，照着耶和华所吩咐我的，将腰带藏在幼发拉底河边。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["过了多日，耶和华对我说：「你起来往幼发拉底河去，将我吩咐你藏在那里的腰带取出来。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我就往幼发拉底河去，将腰带从我所藏的地方刨出来，见腰带已经变坏，毫无用了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["耶和华的话临到我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["「耶和华如此说：我必照样败坏犹大的骄傲和耶路撒冷的大骄傲。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["这恶民不肯听我的话，按自己顽梗的心而行，随从别神，事奉敬拜，他们也必像这腰带变为无用。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和华说：「腰带怎样紧贴人腰，照样，我也使以色列全家和犹大全家紧贴我，好叫他们属我为子民，使我得名声，得颂赞，得荣耀；他们却不肯听。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["酒坛的比喻"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["「所以你要对他们说：『耶和华—以色列的 神如此说：各坛都要盛满了酒。』他们必对你说：『我们岂不确知各坛都要盛满了酒呢？』"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你就要对他们说：『耶和华如此说：我必使这地的一切居民，就是坐大卫宝座的君王和祭司，与先知，并耶路撒冷的一切居民，都酩酊大醉。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["耶和华说：「我要使他们彼此相碰，就是父与子彼此相碰；我必不可怜，不顾惜，不怜悯，以致灭绝他们。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米警告狂傲的行为"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"你们当听，当侧耳而听。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要骄傲，因为耶和华已经说了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华—你们的 神未使黑暗来到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的脚未在昏暗山上绊跌之先，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当将荣耀归给他；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得你们盼望光明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他使光明变为死荫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成为幽暗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们若不听这话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必因你们的骄傲在暗地哭泣；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我眼必痛哭流泪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华的群众被掳去了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"你要对君王和太后说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们当自卑，坐在下边；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你们的头巾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是你们的华冠，已经脱落了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"南方的城尽都关闭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人开放；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大全被掳掠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"且掳掠净尽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"你们要举目观看从北方来的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先前赐给你的群众，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是你佳美的群众，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今在哪里呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华立你自己所交的朋友为首，辖制你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时你还有什么话说呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"痛苦岂不将你抓住像产难的妇人吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你若心里说：这一切事为何临到我呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的衣襟揭起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的脚跟受伤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是因你的罪孽甚多。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古实人岂能改变皮肤呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豹岂能改变斑点呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若能，你们这习惯行恶的便能行善了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我必用旷野的风吹散他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像吹过的碎秸一样。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：这是你所当得的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我量给你的分；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你忘记我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倚靠虚假","poem":1},{"noteId":15},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我要揭起你的衣襟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蒙在你脸上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"显出你的丑陋。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你那些可憎恶之事—","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是在田野的山上行奸淫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"发嘶声，做淫乱的事—","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我都看见了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，你有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不肯洁净，还要到几时呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":15,"caller":"-","text":"或译：偶像","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":25}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":27}